# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. A link gate held past its link wedges every later link.
MODULE: ReturnKeepsLinkGate
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the link returns without releasing the root's link gate
PERTURBS: ReturnLink

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "return"
    /\ lg' = "none"
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "return"
    \* MUTATION: the link gate is kept
    /\ lg' = lg
--- END
